WEBVTT

00:13:59.024 --> 00:14:01.140
China can produce economic growth,

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:02.708
and we like that."

00:14:02.708 --> 00:14:05.422
Because ultimately, the question before us,

00:14:05.422 --> 00:14:07.278
and the question before

00:14:07.278 --> 00:14:08.983
seven billion people on the planet

00:14:08.983 --> 00:14:12.083
is, how can we create prosperity?

00:14:12.083 --> 00:14:14.998
People who care and will pivot towards the model

00:14:14.998 --> 00:14:16.523
of politics and economics

00:14:16.523 --> 00:14:18.090
in a very rational way,

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:20.555
to those models that will ensure

00:14:20.555 --> 00:14:22.536
that they can have better living standards

00:14:22.536 --> 00:14:25.159
in the shortest period of time.

00:14:25.159 --> 00:14:26.870
As you leave here today,

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.275
I would like to leave you

00:14:28.275 --> 00:14:29.928
with a very personal message,

00:14:29.928 --> 00:14:32.014
which is what it is that I believe